---
description: Label markup (D710). Terminals and rule names are drawn as written, a typed entity too; special sequences draw <br>, the tags and entities, and draw other tags as written text (#1440); a special in bare backticks is drawn as written, as only a quoted markdown string reads markdown (#1368). Title and comments are not drawn (D218).
---
railroad-ebnf-beta
title Label <b>markup</b>
(* A comment with <b>tags</b> is skipped. *)
literal = "<b>bold</b>" | "**not bold**" | "a<br>b" | "`**md**`" | "<i>&lt x&gt</i> &amp &#60" ;
tags = ? <b>bold</b> and <i>italic</i> ? , ? first<br>second ? ;
more = ? <u>under</u> <s>struck</s> H<sub>2</sub>O x<sup>2</sup> ? ;
markdown = ? `**bold** and *italic*` ? | ? **stays literal** ? ;
entities = ? a &lt b &amp c, <b>&#60b&#62</b> ? ;
dropped = ? <span>kept</span> text ? | ? <span>kept</span> <b>bold</b> ? ;
